<title>UK: Bank Vontobel sets warrants on Adecco.</title>
<headline>Bank Vontobel sets warrants on Adecco.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Vontobel said it has issued two million American-style call warrants, on Adecco SA bearer shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    550 CHF		   PREMIUM	16.1 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.40 CHF		  GEARING	10.7 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 28.MAY.97-25.MAR.98   PAYDATE	28.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  515 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
